+---
+
+## 6. Efficiency
+
+`eq_ignore_ascii_case` on a suffix is O(len(suffix)) with no allocation, against
+`strip_suffix`'s O(len(suffix)) memcmp. Five suffix probes per filename, once per input file.
+Unmeasurable.
+
